# Choco, Seeker of Paradise (3/5) and Storm Crow (a Bird) attack together: the Birds declared in one attack are one batch (CR 603.2c), so Choco triggers once and
# looks at two cards - a Forest and a Serra Angel (the Island below them is unlooked). At most one may go to the hand (two are refused); Bot1 takes none. Of the cards
# left only the land may enter (the Angel is refused), tapped; the Angel goes to the graveyard. The Forest entering is landfall: Choco 4/5 + Storm Crow 1 = 5, Bot2 on 15.

